# Fungus1_20_v02 from the entry from below (x 166, y 3.39) west along the floor to the gap at x 5 to 9, which drops into Fungus1_21's top hall. The Vengefly King hangs until hit and the walk passes under it.
# Planned with hk-walkplan room on the disc (HK_WALKPLAN_MARGIN=0.4, sync poll) with the whole run before it as the pre, 2026-11-03.
at 166.00 3.39
loop c20-h001 until expr abs(i32(HK_PLAYER_X) - 10271457) <= 58982 && abs(i32(HK_PLAYER_Y) - 222167) <= 19661 max 3 timeout 900
walk 165.17
walk 165.60   # run-up
walk 165.17   # take-off
hold left+cross for 34
hold left for 27
wait 6
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
end
